# Smoke test for tools/dosprobe against GTADOS/GTA8.EXE.
# Boot at fixed 60000 cycles, step past intro/menu prompts if shown,
# capture screenshots + a 1 MiB physical RAM slice, then quit cleanly.
2500 shot boot_2500
3500 tap esc 80
+1000 shot boot_4500
+1000 tap enter 80
+2000 shot boot_7500
+1000 tap enter 80
+2000 shot boot_10500
+100 memdump ram_sample 0x100000 0x100000
+200 quit
